About this file
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Apache-2.0 section 4(d) requires that a redistributor of this work keep a
readable copy of this file's attribution notices. It is deliberately short: the
project carries no third-party dependencies at runtime (see ADR-001), so there
are no bundled components to attribute here.

Clearance must be exemplary about licence compliance, because it is a licence
tool. `make dogfood` runs `clearance check .` against this repository, and it
must pass honestly.

The compiled corpus is distributed separately from the binary and is licensed
CC-BY-4.0, as stated in PLAN/08-BUSINESS/03-legal-posture.md section 6. It is a
data artefact, not a code dependency, and it is not covered by the Apache-2.0
grant above.
